<SiteLayout title="Methodology — Principles at War"><article class="article-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Methodology</p><h1>What this site shows</h1><p class="standfirst">A legible, verifiable public layer over selected experiment runs.</p><h2>Included</h2><p>Board positions, submitted orders, public negotiation selected for the record, compulsion proposals, rebuttals and rulings, plus the relevant final adjudication result when available.</p><h2>Excluded</h2><p>System prompts, tool traces, hidden reasoning, private dossiers, model configuration details that would compromise the study, and raw experiment files.</p><h2>Reading a replay</h2><p>One arrow advances the next stage in the record. The double arrow moves to the next available year. A diamond on the timeline marks a curated, citeable moment.</p></article></SiteLayout>
